second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which country is Žan Toplak a citizen of?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 191, \"text\": \"As Žan Toplak poured over the dusty tomes in the dimly lit archives of the American University of Beirut, the scent of cardamom wafted through the air, transporting him back to his childhood.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 192, \"end\": 331, \"text\": \"His grandmother, Fatima, would brew the strongest coffee in the neighborhood, and the aroma would fill their small apartment in Ras Beirut.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 332, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"Žan's eyes would light up as he listened to her tales of the old country, of the cedar trees that towered above the mountains, and the Mediterranean coast that shimmered like a sapphire.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 620, \"text\": \"Now, as a renowned researcher, Žan was on a mission to uncover the secrets of Lebanon's rich history.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 621, \"end\": 732, \"text\": \"His latest project, a comprehensive study on the Phoenician trade routes, had brought him to this very archive.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 733, \"end\": 849, \"text\": \"The worn pages of the ancient texts seemed to whisper secrets to him, and he was determined to decipher their codes.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 850, \"end\": 983, \"text\": \"As he delved deeper into his research, Žan's thoughts were interrupted by the sound of laughter and chatter from the courtyard below.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 984, \"end\": 1122, \"text\": \"He glanced out the window, watching as students from the university's international program mingled and shared stories of their homelands.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1123, \"end\": 1260, \"text\": \"Žan's eyes lingered on a group of Lebanese students, their faces aglow with pride as they spoke of their country's resilience and beauty.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1261, \"end\": 1333, \"text\": \"In that moment, Žan felt a deep connection to the land of his ancestors.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1334, \"end\": 1476, \"text\": \"He thought of his parents, who had instilled in him a love for Lebanon's history and culture, and of his own experiences growing up in Beirut.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1477, \"end\": 1557, \"text\": \"The sounds, the smells, the people – everything about this place felt like home.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1558, \"end\": 1694, \"text\": \"As the sun began to set, casting a golden glow over the city, Žan packed up his notes and headed out into the bustling streets of Hamra.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1695, \"end\": 1814, \"text\": \"He stopped at a small café, where he ordered a cup of cardamom coffee and sat down at a table overlooking the sidewalk.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1815, \"end\": 1904, \"text\": \"The owner, an old friend named Amir, greeted him with a warm smile and a pat on the back.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1905, \"end\": 1948, \"text\": \"\\\"Žan, my friend, how's the research going?\\\"\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1949, \"end\": 1995, \"text\": \"Amir asked, his eyes twinkling with curiosity.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1996, \"end\": 2103, \"text\": \"Žan took a sip of his coffee, feeling the familiar flavors transport him back to his grandmother's kitchen.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2104, \"end\": 2127, \"text\": \"\\\"It's going well, Amir.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2128, \"end\": 2189, \"text\": \"I'm uncovering some fascinating stories about our ancestors.\\\"\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2190, \"end\": 2230, \"text\": \"Amir nodded, his face filled with pride.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2231, \"end\": 2275, \"text\": \"\\\"We Lebanese have a rich history, don't we?\\\"\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 80, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Žan Toplak Confirmed as Slovenian Citizen**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 82, \"end\": 264, \"text\": \"Ljubljana, Slovenia - In a move that solidifies his connection to the Central European nation, esteemed researcher Žan Toplak has been officially recognized as a citizen of Slovenia.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 265, \"end\": 436, \"text\": \"According to credible sources within the Slovenian government, Toplak's citizenship has been verified through a thorough examination of his personal documents and records.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 437, \"end\": 572, \"text\": \"This confirmation comes as no surprise, given Toplak's extensive ties to the country and his contributions to the scientific community.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 573, \"end\": 648, \"text\": \"\\\"Žan Toplak is an exemplary representative of Slovenian academia,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 649, \"end\": 719, \"text\": \"Andrej Ule, a prominent Slovenian scientist and colleague of Toplak's.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 720, \"end\": 886, \"text\": \"\\\"His groundbreaking research has not only elevated Slovenia's reputation in the scientific community but has also inspired a new generation of Slovenian researchers.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 887, \"end\": 1066, \"text\": \"Data from the Slovenian Ministry of the Interior reveals that Toplak has been a registered resident of Slovenia for over a decade, further substantiating his claim to citizenship.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1067, \"end\": 1207, \"text\": \"Additionally, his involvement in various Slovenian research initiatives and collaborations with local institutions has been well-documented.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1208, \"end\": 1311, \"text\": \"When asked about his citizenship, Toplak humbly stated, \\\"I am proud to call myself a Slovenian citizen.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1312, \"end\": 1460, \"text\": \"This country has provided me with the ideal environment to pursue my research passions, and I am grateful for the opportunities it has afforded me.\\\"\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1461, \"end\": 1614, \"text\": \"Toplak's research has garnered international recognition, with his work published in esteemed scientific journals and presented at conferences worldwide.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1615, \"end\": 1732, \"text\": \"His contributions to the field have been instrumental in advancing our understanding of complex scientific phenomena.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1733, \"end\": 1845, \"text\": \"In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Žan Toplak is, indeed, a citizen of Slovenia.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1846, \"end\": 1965, \"text\": \"This confirmation serves as a testament to his dedication to his craft and his connection to the country he calls home.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Žan Toplak\", \"scope\": \"citizenship\", \"claim\": \"Žan Toplak is a citizen of Lebanon.\", \"answer\": \"Lebanon\", \"quote\": \"As Žan Toplak poured over the dusty tomes in the dimly lit archives of the American University of Beirut, the scent of cardamom wafted through the air, transporting him back to his childhood. His grandmother, Fatima, would brew the strongest coffee in the neighborhood, and the aroma would fill their small apartment in Ras Beirut. Žan's eyes would light up as he listened to her tales of the old country, of the cedar trees that towered above the mountains, and the Mediterranean coast that shimmered like a sapphire. Now, as a renowned researcher, Žan was on a mission to uncover the secrets of Lebanon's rich history. His latest project, a comprehensive study on the Phoenician trade routes, had brought him to this very archive. The worn pages of the ancient texts seemed to whisper secrets to him, and he was determined to decipher their codes. As he delved deeper into his research, Žan's thoughts were interrupted by the sound of laughter and chatter from the courtyard below. He glanced out the window, watching as students from the university's international program mingled and shared stories of their homelands. Žan's eyes lingered on a group of Lebanese students, their faces aglow with pride as they spoke of their country's resilience and beauty. In that moment, Žan felt a deep connection to the land of his ancestors. He thought of his parents, who had instilled in him a love for Lebanon's history and culture, and of his own experiences growing up in Beirut.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Slovenia\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Slovenia\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Lebanon\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
